Data notes: the GCBD extracts (data/gcbd_global_bleaching_environmental.csv,
data/china_bco_dmo_bleaching.csv, data/raw_sources/*) derive from the Global
Coral Bleaching Database (van Woesik & Kratochwill, Scientific Data 9, 20
(2022); CC-BY 4.0). NOAA Coral Reef Watch products are U.S. Government public
domain. ESA OC-CCI chlorophyll is distributed by CEDA; MODIS-Aqua PAR by NASA
OceanColor Web; ERA5 by Copernicus C3S - see data/README.md for the download
chain.
